# Learning project — do not implement for the developer

This repository is a **hands-on async runtime learning project**. The developer writes all implementation code themselves.

## Never edit without explicit permission

- `src/**` — all Rust implementation code
- `Cargo.toml` — dependencies and crate config

## OK to edit

- `challenge/**` — step instructions, hints, verify checklists
- `challenge.md`, `README.md` — project documentation
- `.cursor/rules/**` — agent guidance

## When helping

- Explain concepts, review code, debug errors, suggest approaches
- Challenge docs describe outcomes and verify checklists — not full solutions in `src/`
- Do not run broad refactors or "implement step N for you" unless the developer explicitly asks for a one-off exception on a specific file or problem
